md-openmm build-top
====================================================================

Command
-------
  input                       input/complex.pdb
  config                      build/build.config
  system out                  build/built.xml
  topology out                build/built.pdb

Resolved configuration
----------------------
  solute.kind                 complex   (set)
  solute.peptide              None   (default)
  solute.ligand_forcefield    sage-2.2.1   (default)
  solute.ligand_charge_method am1bcc   (default)
  solute.compound_id          None   (default)
  solute.aliases              []   (default)
  solute.parameters           search   (default)
  solute.residue_name         None   (default)
  forcefield.protein          ff19SB   (set)
  solvent.model               OPC   (set)
  solvent.padding_nm          0.6   (set)
  solvent.box_shape           cube   (set)
  solvent.ionic_strength_molar0.0   (set)
  solvent.positive_ion        Na+   (default)
  solvent.negative_ion        Cl-   (default)
  solvent.cutoff_nm           0.9   (set)
  constraints.type            HBonds   (set)
  constraints.rigid_water     True   (set)

Input interpretation
--------------------
  interpreted as              protein-ligand complex (.pdb), 1 ligand instance(s) mapped to parameter packages
  ligand ETA                  chain 'B' resid '201' icode '' -> LOCAL-OTMSDBZUPAUEDD/param_cf41a2bd76f4
  coordinates                 the deposited pose; ligand hydrogens from each package
  small-molecule FF           not run: parameters loaded from the packages
  solvent treatment           explicit OPC, periodic
  protein FF                  amber19-all.xml
  water FF                    amber19/opc.xml

Preparation
-----------
  ligand       : ETA chain 'B' resid '201' icode '' -> LOCAL-OTMSDBZUPAUEDD/param_cf41a2bd76f4
  protonation  : pH 7.0, 18 -> 18 hydrogens; 1 ligand instance(s) kept as packaged
  protonation  : method openmm
  solvation    : 180 waters, ions {}, box cube (6.9 nm^3)
  system       : PME, cutoff 0.9 nm, HBonds

Validation
----------
  particle agreement          750 atoms == 750 particles  OK
  periodicity                 periodic  OK (explicit)
  box vectors (nm)            (1.900 0.000 0.000); (0.000 1.900 0.000); (0.000 0.000 1.900)
  HMR                         NOT applied; masses are the force field's own, recommend 2.0 fs
  distinct H masses           [1.0079, 1.008]

Counts
------
  atoms                       750
  residues                    184
  solute atoms                30
  waters                      180
  ions                        {}
  forcefield                  amber19-all.xml

Outputs
-------
  built.xml                   build/built.xml
  built.pdb                   build/built.pdb
  built.solute.pdb            build/built.solute.pdb
  ligand_mapping.json         build/ligand_mapping.json
  re-read check               750 atoms == 750 particles  OK
  ligand packages             LOCAL-OTMSDBZUPAUEDD/param_cf41a2bd76f4 (written)

Summary
-------
  built 750 particles, 184 residues, explicit OPC
  status: completed

